  "verification_evidence": "The urea medium for enrichment was preparation anaerobic. Specifically, the medium (100 ml) contained 5 ml of clarified rumen fluid, 0.05 g urea, 0.05 g glucose, 0.05 g cellulose, 15 ml solution 4 (3 g/l K2HPO4), 15 ml solution 5 (0.6 g/l CaCl2, 3 g/l KH2PO4, 6 g/l NaCl, 0.6 g/l MgSO4·7H2O), 0.1 ml Pfennig trace element (300 mg/L H3BO3, 100 mg/L ZnSO4·7H2O, 30 mg/l MnCl2·4H2O, 20 mg/l CoCl2·6H2O, ",
  "verification_confidence": "high",
